noncomputable section

open NumberField Matrix MeasureTheory GlobalTheory.CuspRep GlobalTheory.CuspRep.CuspidalL2GL GlobalTheory.ThetaPoisson GroundTheory.Global GroundTheory.Global.IdeleGroup
